@startuml sequence-mileage-adapter
title Sequence: Mileage Payment via Adapter (Iteration 4 — Adapter)\n(red lifelines/messages = iteration 4 additions)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #888
hide footbox
autonumber

actor Member
participant "PaymentController\n(JavaFX)" as UI
participant "BookingController" as BC
participant "SkypassAdapter\n<<Adapter / Target>>" as AD #FFCCCC
participant "RemoteSkypassApi\n<<Adaptee>>" as API #FFCCCC

Member -> UI : pay with mileage
activate UI
UI -> BC : confirmMileagePayment(reservation, skypassNo, amount)
activate BC
BC -[#CC0000]> AD : verifyAndDeduct(skypassNo, amount)
activate AD
note right of AD #FFF0F0
  Adapter converts the domain call into the
  external API's two-step shape (no single endpoint).
end note
AD -[#CC0000]> API : getMileage(skypassNo)
activate API
API --> AD : Map{status,balance}
deactivate API
AD -[#CC0000]> API : postDeduct(skypassNo, amount)
activate API
API --> AD : Map{success}
deactivate API
AD --> BC : skypassNo (ok) / null
deactivate AD
BC --> UI : Payment (MILEAGE)
deactivate BC
UI --> Member : confirmation
deactivate UI
@enduml
